/home/antonioborgerees/coding/ultraplan/gauntlet-run/ultraplan-go/docs/configuration.md:214:Smoke configuration is resolved after manifest defaults and before command/TUI overrides. UltraPlan passes only named environment variables; values never appear in config output, JSON, Markdown, or TUI diagnostics. The built-in platform set is limited to `TMPDIR`, `LANG`, and `LC_ALL`; `PATH` and `HOME` are not forwarded by default. Add a manifest-declared name to `smoke.environment` only when the harness genuinely needs it. The real-harness test lane is opt-in with `ULTRAPLAN_REAL_SMOKE=1`; normal tests never launch it.
