336-```
337-
338-Runs bounded read-only conformance reviewers and atomically writes `review.md`. Compatible interrupted attempts resume validated coverage and retained OpenCode sessions. Use `--restart` to discard the resumable attempt and start fresh. A focused rerun promotes only when all other coverage can be retained from the same current fingerprint.
